<article class="env-lemma" id="011K">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/011K">Lemma <span data-tag="011K">12.14.11</span>.</a> Notation and assumptions as in Lemma <a href="/tag/011J" data-tag="011J">12.14.10</a> above. Assume in addition that $\mathcal{A}$ is abelian. The morphism of complexes $\delta : C^\bullet \to A[1]^\bullet $ induces the maps </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  H^ i(\delta ) : H^ i(C^\bullet ) \longrightarrow H^ i(A[1]^\bullet ) = H^{i + 1}(A^\bullet )  \]
</div>
  <p> which occur in the long exact homology sequence associated to the short exact sequence of cochain complexes by Lemma <a href="/tag/0117" data-tag="0117">12.13.12</a>. </p>
